      "user_id": 330919,
      "full_name": "Neil Batlivala",
      "title": "Founder",
      "founder_bio": "I am a technical entrepreneur, YC alumni, and co-founder of Pair Team (YC S19). I've spent the majority of my career in healthcare and had the honor of working with some exceptional people while building remote medical teams at Sling, opening primary care practices at Forward, designing medical devices at Spect, training machine learning models at Noxon, and researching pneumonia at UCSF.\n\n50% thrill seeker, 40% dad jokes, 15% math. ",
